+	// IDPS: each step's wall time is kept on an absolute schedule, so time lost to oversleeping or a
+	// busy host is caught up (sim steps run back to back) instead of the simulated clock falling behind
+	// the wall clock for good (~3 % slow, with 50-100 ms jumps when the host stalls). Over a second
+	// behind (a debugger, a suspended laptop): start the schedule again from now. The schedule runs on
